  "title": "The Benefits of Internal Curing with Arcosa Lightweight Aggregates",
  "summary": "Internally cured concrete more readily resists early age shrinkage, curling, warping, and cracking by supplying water throughout the concrete mix over time. Internal curing can also increase concrete’s strength and reduce its permeability. These qualities help prolong the concrete’s service life, even when placed in harsh environments.",
